            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**MARKED PREY**\n\nAt the start of your Command phase, select one unit from your opponent’s army. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a **WAR DOG** model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, if that unit is visible to the attacking model, that attack has the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability."
      },
      "Detachment§Hunting Warpack": {
        "keywords": {
          "Role": [
            "Reconnaissance"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Detachment Points": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**SCENTING FEAR**\n\n(Once per battle round, per army) In your Shooting phase, you can select one **visible** enemy unit within 12\" of a friendly **WAR DOG** unit. That enemy unit has +6\" **detection range**.\nThis **detachment** has the **WAR DOGS** tag and cannot be taken with another **WAR DOGS** **detachment**.",
        "rules": {
