      "Stratagem§A Long Leash": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ABHORRENT** model from your army and up to two friendly **WAR DOG** units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, those **WAR DOG** units are treated as being within range of any Aura abilities your **ABHORRENT** unit has."
      },
      "Stratagem§Animalistic Rage": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after a **WAR DOG** unit from your army that has not been **selected to attack** this phase is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAR DOG** unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Before resolving your unit’s Deadly Demise ability, it can either shoot or fight. When doing so, it must target only the enemy unit that just destroyed it, and can only do so if that enemy unit is an eligible target. After it has done so and after any Consolidation moves have been made, resolve your unit’s Deadly Demise ability as normal."
      },
      "Stratagem§Avenge the Masters!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Iconoclast Fiefdom"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit is **destroyed** by an enemy unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That enemy unit is **marked** until the end of the battle.\n\n- Friendly **DAMNED** units’ attacks that target a **marked** unit have **[LETHAL HITS]**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Beasthide Manifestation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Claimed for the Dark Gods": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army that is within range of one or more objective markers you control.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one of those objective markers. That objective marker remains under your control, with a Level of Control of 5 (unless it would otherwise be higher), until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Conquerors Without Mercy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** model from your army that made a Charge move this turn and has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by your model by 1. After your model has finished making its attacks this phase, if it destroyed one or more enemy units this phase, each enemy unit within 6\" of your model must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Contemptuous Volleys": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army Falls Back.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Corrupting Taint": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase, just after a **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army makes a Malefic Surge.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one objective marker your unit is within range of that you control. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Crushed Like Vermin": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army ends a Normal move.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES)** that your unit moved over during that move and roll six D6: for each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound. If one or more models are destroyed as a result of this Stratagem, that enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Cunning Hunter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **WAR DOG** unit from your army Falls Back\n\n**TARGET:** That **WAR DOG** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Diabolic Bulwark": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Stratagem§Disdain For the Weak": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your model has the Feel No Pain 6+ ability, and the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against attacks made by Battle-shocked models."
      },
      "Stratagem§Encircling Pack": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WAR DOG** unit from your army that is wholly within 12\" of one or more battlefield edges and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Feral Arrogance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a mortal wound is allocated to a **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Flush the Quarry": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army and up to three friendly **WAR DOG** units within 6\" of that **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time one of those **WAR DOG** units makes a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move, its models can move through models and terrain features. When doing so, they can move within Engagement Range of such models but cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed."
      },
      "Stratagem§Goaded Beast": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that lost one or more wounds as a result of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6\""
      },
      "Stratagem§Harrying Hounds": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WAR DOG** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hellforged Construction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hungry for Combat": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Two or more **WAR DOG** units from your army within Engagement Range of the same enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of those **WAR DOG** units. Until the end of the phase, models in those **WAR DOG** units can only target that enemy unit, but each time a model in one of those **WAR DOG** units makes an attack, an unmodified Hit roll of 5+ scores a Critical Hit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Imperious Advance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Up to two **WAR DOG** units from your army or one **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in one of your units makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, it can move through models and terrain features. When doing so, it can move within Engagement Range of such models but, unless it made a Charge move, cannot end that move within Engagement Range of them, and any Desperate Escape test is automatically passed (the Super-heavy Walker ability does not apply while using this Stratagem)."
      },
      "Stratagem§Merciless Fusillade": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Helhunt Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army, and up to two friendly **WAR DOG** units, that have not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit that is an eligible target for each of those **CHAOS KNIGHTS** units. Until the end of the phase, each time one of those **CHAOS KNIGHTS** units is selected to shoot or fight, if that enemy unit is an eligible target, you can only select that enemy unit as the target for all of those attacks and those attacks have the **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Profane Symbiosis": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that is not Empowered.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit makes a Malefic Surge.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot select the same unit as the target of this Stratagem more than once per battle round."
      },
      "Stratagem§Pterrorshades": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an enemy unit fails a Battle-shock test.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that is within 12\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll six D6. For each 4+, that enemy unit suffers 1 mortal wound and one model in your unit regains up to 1 lost wound.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per battle round."
      },
      "Stratagem§Runes of Disdain": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
