          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Spiteful Demise": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** When rolling to determine whether mortal wounds are inflicted by your unit’s Deadly Demise ability, that model’s Deadly Demise ability inflicts mortal wounds on a D6 roll of a 4+ instead of on a 6."
      },
      "Stratagem§Storm of Darkness": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Traitoris Lance"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** • Your unit has **Stealth**.\n• Melee attacks that target your unit have -1 to **hit rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Titanic Duel": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** unit. Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1. Each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, if that enemy unit is **TITANIC,** you can re-roll the Hit roll and you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Trophy Hunter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Lords of Dread"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just before a **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit from your army consolidates.\n\n**TARGET:** That **CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit Consolidates, models in it can move an additional 3\" as long as your unit can end that move within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unleash Balefire": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Wargear"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** After your unit has shot, select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That enemy unit must take a Battle-shock test; if the test is failed, until the end of your opponent’s next turn, it is aflame. While a unit is aflame, subtract 2\" from its Move characteristic and subtract 2 from Charge rolls made for it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vox-Howl": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Houndpack Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
