          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of the Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WAR DOG CHARACTER** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each enemy unit within 6\" of your unit must take a Battle-shock test. Each friendly **WAR DOG** unit that is within 6\" of your unit and is Battle-shocked must take a Leadership test; if that test is passed, that unit is no longer Battle-shocked.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warp Vision": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Chaos Knights",
            "Infernal Lance"
          ],
          "Category": [
