          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[IGNORES COVER]** ability."
      },
